{
  "id": "sai-pao",
  "title": "赛跑",
  "cover": "images/sai-pao/07.jpg",
  "image": "images/sai-pao/01.jpg",
  "theme": "#FF8A65",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "兔子和乌龟参加赛跑。",
          "image": "images/sai-pao/01.jpg"
        },
        {
          "text": "兔子嘲笑乌龟跑得慢，很快把乌龟远远甩在后面，",
          "image": "images/sai-pao/02.jpg"
        },
        {
          "text": "可是它跑得太快，一不小心被石头绊倒了，脚受了伤。",
          "image": "images/sai-pao/03.jpg"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "乌龟追上来后让兔子坐到自己背上，",
          "image": "images/sai-pao/04.jpg"
        },
        {
          "text": "然后继续朝着终点前进。",
          "image": "images/sai-pao/05.jpg"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "最后，乌龟和兔子共同取得了胜利，",
          "image": "images/sai-pao/06.jpg"
        },
        {
          "text": "它们高高举起手里的奖杯，开心地笑了。",
          "image": "images/sai-pao/07.jpg"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "newChars": [
    "胜",
    "利",
    "举",
    "杯"
  ],
  "words": [
    "胜利",
    "奖杯"
  ],
  "pinyinOverrides": {
    "跑得": "pǎo de",
    "背上": "bèi shàng",
    "朝着": "cháo zhe"
  }
}